  "description": "No longer required to keep his identity and purpose a secret, Palpatine embraces his true persona of Darth Sidious and taunts the one entity powerful enough to challenge his absolute authority, Jedi Master Yoda. The two face off in Palpatine's office just below the currently-empty senate chamber, using amazing Force energy to get the better of each other. They dramatically ascend into the deserted chamber itself, battling like titans as senate pods are tossed about like toys. Yoda finally manages to escape from a seemingly endless struggle, whisked from the scene by prudent ally Bail Organa."
